{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"How is it, giving so much out here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:01:50.499000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870139027255336960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Oh, it's not so hard. It only takes a little hope to go a long way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:04:22.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870139665741647933","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Hope really is something, ain't it. Well, I thought I'd come out here and share some of mine. I have plenty to spare, even now\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:05:11.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870139869861670935","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Really?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:07:05.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870140347836145814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"It's never wavered. I'm inspired by everyone around me and all the life they've given me. I share what I can to them, but it feels like this is the place that needs to share in my hope a bit more\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:07:59.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870140576631250986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Thats pretty rare you know. Almost no one gives out hope. I mean sure, people give up hope, but thats not really the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:08:14.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870140637104709693","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Then I feel I'm the right person to help in this job, I just don't quite know how to share it out here\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:09:25.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870140936645148733","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Lamplighting, revolutions, smuggling, friends in high and low places, I'm part of it all to help however I can. But I have more to give when it comes to helping people and this land\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:10:18.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870141156476985375","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"I know all it takes is a spark. Like the idea of lamplighting. So I'm here to try and light that spark\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:10:43.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870141260860645386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Giving out hope is a tiring task. If ever you find your self running low, be sure to come back, and I will help you. Because. Well, because you took the time to talk to me. and I like your mustache.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:11:26.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870141442297827348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"Thanks, I chose it myself\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:13:53.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870142058227187772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"\"And same for you. If you ever feel drained, come by for a chat\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T03:14:18.279000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870142163671994378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
